        # AP-EVOKED RELEASE
        #
        # Exactly N_RELEASE vesicles are released onto the
        # selected postsynaptic neuron.
        #
        # The current equation itself is unchanged:
        #
        # dI/dt = -I/tau_i
        #
        # The AP only creates the instantaneous jump:
